Abstract = {The research adopted Chinese College Students Psychology Test and
   International Physical Activity Questionnaire to analyze the
   relationship among students' physical activity, psychological stress,
   mental health, psychological adoption. The results showed that physical
   activity can lower the level of psychological stress and psychology
   pressure, diminish depression, self-abasement and dependence, improve
   the adaptation on interpersonal relation, campus living and emotion. The
   effects of vigorous and moderate intensity physical activity were
   different.},
