   Univ Polytechn Bucharest; Univ Teknologi MARA},
Abstract = {We develop a model to analyze the data and then create a safety rating
   to specify a measure of how safe My City is. The goal is to use safety
   rating so as to evaluate the safeness of My City. Using historical data
   from the police reports in My City, we capture the essential elements of
   urban public safety, like crime rate, crime severity and detection rate.
   To establish a social security evaluating indicator system, we entrusts
   with the weight to each of elements by means of Expert's Judgement.
   Next, we use our full model based on each weight to evaluate the
   safeness of My City. Our suggested solution, which is easy to implement,
   includes a social security evaluating indicator system and a safety
   rating of the city.},
