Abstract = {Augmented Cognition manifesting in the DARPA project is becoming of more
   and more interest to non-military application areas. First areas it is
   going to be applied are in flight; control and power plant control.
   Measuring cognitive workload in the context of Augmented Cognition is
   bound to the application of sensor technologies and frameworks which are
   going to be applied to users. It is necessary to make Augmented
   Cognition Application in non-military areas as comfortable to tire user
   as possible as we do riot want to disturb her but to support her in her
   tasks. In this paper we will define criteria, to be considered when
