   Hospitality Management and Education Session, Berlin, GERMANY, JUN
   15-18, 2012},
Organization = {German Acad Exchange Serv Fdn; IMRE Alumni Network},
Abstract = {In the past decades, human beings have obtained great economical
   achievements and made scientific and technological progress. However,
   they have paid heavy price of continuous deterioration of ecological
   environment. In recent years, People speed up the adjustment of their
   relationship with nature. The development of blue economy attracts
   increasingly more attention from all over the world. Rizhao is the
   crucial part of ``Shandong peninsula blue economic zone development
   plan{''}. With practical developing orientation and spatial arrangement,
   Rizhao will be an important industrial base in the east of China, a
   regional logistics center of international shipping, a littoral cultural
   and tourist city, a technical and educational innovation zone through
   ten years' hard working. This paper puts forward some suggestions on
   Rizhao's coordination between ecological environment and economy, based
   on thorough study of the practical development of Rizhao's industrial
   construction and leading industries. The author hopes to provide
   theoretical reference for strategic development of medium coastal cities
   in east China.},
