   Zaharia, Carmen; Jufa, Claudia, Gheorghe Asachi Tech Univ Iasi, Fac Chem Engn \& Environm Protect, Dept Environm Engn \& Management, 73 Prof Dr Docent D Mangeron Blvd, Iasi 700050, Romania.},
DOI = {10.30638/eemj.2017.063},
