   Sensing (SMPR), 6th Conf on Earth Observation of Environmental Changes
   (EOEC), Tehran, IRAN, OCT 07-10, 2017},
Organization = {Int Soc Photogrammetry \& Remote Sensing},
Abstract = {Increasing world population and unprecedented expansion of urbanization
   in the world has caused many environmental problems. The relationship
   between man and the environment is bidirectional one that have great
   short-term and long-term impacts on the cities and regions. The best way
   to deal with it is the participation of the people themselves. The use
