   Management},
Abstract = {Twin-arch double-deck tunnel is a new tunnel structure. It is of great
   practical significance to alleviate the pressure of urban traffic. With
   the high-speed development of the national economy in China, its
   application will be more widely in the city. The study on construction
   mechanics behavior and adjacent construction effects of twin-arch
   double-deck tunnel is very little. Relying on twin-arch double-deck
   tunnel of Longhui road in Zigong city, its construction mechanics
   behavior and adjacent construction effects were studied by
   three-dimensional numerical simulation techniques. It shows that: tunnel
   structure can meet the force requirements before the pile load is
   imposed; Although the unfavorable change of structure stress has
   happened after imposed pile load, tunnel structure still meet the force
   requirements. Research results provide references for design and wide
   application of twin-arch double-deck tunnel in the city.},
