   Management, NEW YORK, NY, SEP 13-18, 1998},
Organization = {Int Assoc Probabilist Safety Assessment \& Management; Amer Inst Chem
   Engineers; Amer Nucl Soc; Amer Soc Civil Engineers; Amer Soc Mech
   Engineers; Atom Energy Soc Japan; European Nucl Soc; European Safety \&
   Reliabil Assoc; Fed Aviat Adm; Human Factors Soc; Inst Elect \& Electr
   Engineers; Int Atom Energy Agcy; European Union, Joint Res Ctr; NASA;
   Org Econ Cooperat \& Dev; Soc Risk Analy; Syst Safety Soc; UK Safety \&
   Reliabil Soc; US Coast Guard; US DOE; US Nucl Regulatory Commiss;
