   States. Low-dose computed tomography (LDCT) for lung cancer screening
   (LCS) can reduce lung cancer deaths by 20\% compared to chest x-rays.
   Nevertheless, the uptake of LDCT is low for high-risk smokers. In this
   study we used Twitter data to understand laypeople's emotions towards
   LCS, find topics on LCS-related tweets, and assess the impact of
   promotional information on laypeople's discussions.},
