   AND ENVIRONMENT-FRIENDLY SOCIETY},
Year = {2009},
Pages = {74-78},
Note = {International Symposium on Sustainable-Development-of-City-Group,
   Changsha, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 16, 2009},
Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {As the over-exploitation of resources, energy consumption and serious
   destruction to natural environment, people all over the world actively
   promote natural, social and economic sustainable development. Foreign
   communities have obtained some successful experiences and effects. The
   foreign typical patterns are focused on smart growth of the US, zero
   energy development of the UK, ecological residential community of
   Finland. The three typical patterns give some references to the
   resource-conserving and eco-friendly community of China. Their
   successful experiences mainly focus on precise targets, specific
   projects, extensive public participation, evaluation management system
   and perfect legal policy guarantee. To build a resource-conserving,
   environment-friendly, economically efficient, and harmonious society,.
   China needs to be active in its practice of an resource-conserving and
   eco-friendly community. It is an realistic significance for China to
   learn foreign successful experiences and know own deficiencies.},
