   Geophys; Chinese Acad Sci; Engn Technol Press},
Abstract = {Because of the toxicity property of chromium in the water, it is
   important for the water environment to monitor the trace chromium with a
   kind of simple and sensitive method. Spectrophotometry of CAS and CTMAB
   is adopted to determine chromium in the Fu-yang river. The results
   indicates that the detected limit of this method is 0.0005 ug/mL, the
   mark-on recovery ranged from 87.7\% to 97.0\% and relative standard
   deviation is 5.0\%. In addition, several problems needing attention
   about experiment process are posed in this paper.},
