Abstract = {Samaranch is an old friend of the Chinese people in the past 30 years on
   the way of contacting with China, he showed great enthusiasm and
   sincerity in promoting the economic and cultural exchanges and concern
   for the Chinese people's lives and health of the course of history, his
   significant contribution, including work for the development of China
   sports based on all Chinese people respect and affection. Samaranch's a
   prominent diplomat, an international Olympic movement of the great man
   and his connection with the Chinese sports. From the 1970s, Samaranch
   who come from Spain as the friend support China and China's sports work,
   cause for China's sports team, development and sports undertakings
   progress made outstanding contributions, doing the work to sum up with
   China in sports of history and experience, the sports development in
   China on the important position, we have taken the great man's effort
   and experience, continue to do the work of the China sports for the
   future international sporting competition on the most important way.
   Using literature data and logical analysis, review the history beginning
   and close contact between Juan Antonio Samaranch and the Chinese sports,
   do analysis for his outstanding contributions to the development and
   progress of Chinese sports, summed up the historical experience between
   two sides contact, then direct the important position of Samaranch in
   the history of Chinese sports development.},
