Note = {21st Pan-Asian Congress of Sports and Physical Education, Jiangxi Normal
   Univ, Nanchang, PEOPLES R CHINA, APR 23-25, 2010},
Organization = {Pan Asian Soc Sports \& Phys Educ},
Abstract = {The research aims at understanding the status quo and the relationship
   between personality diathesis and coping styles for the sports major
   college students The scale adopted is compiled by Tianjin Normal
   University of China In this study about 3,000 subjects are selected by
   using the cluster random sampling and the questionnaires are
   administered to sports major college students in Jiangxi and Guangdong
   Province of China There are 2420 valid questionnaires left after
   excluding the invalid ones The average age of the students is 18 93 +/-
   111 years old and among them, 1114 are males and 1306 females, 1,250 are
   freshmen and 1170 juniors Among Sports majors of different genders,
   there are significant differences in will (p<0 01),adventure (p <0 01),
   optimism- pessimism (p <0 01), responsibility (p <0 01), independence (p
   <0 01) and the total score of personality diathesis (p <0 01)
   Significant differences are also shown m optimism- pessimism factors as
   to the sports majors of different grades Though the other factors on the
   scale don't reach the level significant difference the total score of
   the freshmen is, on the whole, higher than that of the juniors in
   personality scale, different gender brings no significant differences to
   coping styles yet the males' score is higher than that of the females
   Subjects in different grades show significant differences on coping
   styles, but the males' score is higher than the females' Different grade
   students show significant difference on problem-focused strategies (p <0
   01) emotion focused action strategy (p <0 01) and the total score of
   coping styles(p <0 05), extroversion, optimism - pessimism,
   responsibility, frustration tolerance and the total score of personality
   diathesis scale has a significant positive correlation with each factor
   of coping style, but those factors of personality diathesis scale are
   significantly negatively correlated with the emotion expression
   strategies and adventure Moreover, independence factor have
   significantly positive correlated with the each factor of coping style
   scale On the whole personality diathesis of the males is better than
   that of the females and the personality diathesis of the freshmen
   superior to that of the juniors While the males tend to adopt the
   `problem oriented coping strategy{''}, the females are inclined to the
   ``emotion focused body strategies{''}, and the coping style of the
   freshmen is better than that of the juniors There is evident correlation
   between personality diathesis and coping styles of sports major college
   students},
