Abstract = {The waste of office is a major source of municipal solid waste. Taking
   the imperfect and poor-running recycling system into account, we may
   start with establishing a pilot recycling system in China's urban areas,
   in the hope of exploring its organizational and operational mechanisms.
   A questionnaire-based survey among the office staff is implemented.
